---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Saielle DaSilva · Product Leader</p>
    <h1>I speak <em>four</em> languages: design, product, data &amp; AI.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Hi, I'm Saielle. I help teams choose their direction deliberately.
      I translate between the studio, the boardroom, the spreadsheet and
      the model to deliver business impact and customer outcomes.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact">Work with me</a>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="/about">My story</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap manifesto">
    <p>
      Most teams don't lack talent or tools. They lack intention, a shared
      set of answers about why their work matters. Helping organisations
      find those answers is my craft.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap lanes" aria-label="What I do">
    <ol>
      <li class="lane">
        <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3>Leadership &amp; advisory</h3>
        <p>
          Fractional product leadership and strategic advisory for teams
          navigating design, data and AI at once.
        </p>
        <a class="link-arrow" href="/contact"><span>Work with me</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="lane">
        <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3>Speaking</h3>
        <p>
          Talks and workshops on building intentional products in the age of
          AI: honest, practical, hype-free.
        </p>
        <a class="link-arrow" href="/speaking"><span>See talks</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="lane">
        <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h3>Writing</h3>
        <p>
          Notes on craft, leadership and learning in public. New essays land
          on Substack first.
        </p>
        <a class="link-arrow" href="/writing"><span>Read along</span></a>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap receipts" aria-label="Track record">
    <h2>A leader across technologies</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      Enterprise AI keeps failing for human reasons, not technical ones. I'm
      the product leader who makes AI intentional: from experiment to
      production at scale. Fifteen years of translating between the studio,
      the spreadsheet and the boardroom.
    </p>
    <ol class="receipts-grid">
      <li class="receipt">
        <span class="receipt-org">Cazoo</span>
        <p>The UK's first fully digital car-buying experience; founding team through hyper-growth to a $7B IPO.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="receipt">
        <span class="receipt-org">Sainsbury's</span>
        <p>Enterprise AI taken from a handful of experiments to a production platform serving millions of customers.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="receipt">
        <span class="receipt-org">Interim CPO</span>
        <p>+450% MRR in 90 days.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="receipt">
        <span class="receipt-org">StepStone</span>
        <p>Some of the earliest LLM-powered products in European recruitment: 26 global job markets, millions of candidates.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="receipts-kicker">Four receipts beat any adjective.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
